     <http://bird-bird_superhero-ontology-20260809-235515/ontology/vkg-bird_superhero/Superhero/height_cm> ?height_cm .
  ?pub a <http://bird-bird_superhero-ontology-20260809-235515/ontology/vkg-bird_superhero/Publisher> ;
